<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>MT100 Loading & Tie-Down Guide | Pinnacle Equipment</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Quick-reference loading and tie-down guide for transporting the Bobcat MT100 with the Pinnacle Equipment trailer." />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0a;
      --panel: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --panel-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
      --text: #ffffff;
      --muted: #c7c7c7;
      --muted-2: #9ca3af;
      --green: #6F8A3A;
      --silver: #C2C2C2;
      --green-soft: rgba(111,138,58,0.12);
      --red: #b95b55;
      --red-soft: rgba(185,91,85,0.10);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Inter, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

    .container {
      width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 48px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section { padding: 78px 0; }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--green);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.26em;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }

    .section-copy {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      max-width: 780px;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--panel);
      border-radius: 28px;
    }

    .muted-band {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    /* HERO + NAV — mirrors the landing page style */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      min-height: 72vh;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(111,138,58,0.18), transparent 35%),
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.72), rgba(0,0,0,0.82));
    }

    .hero-grid {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      opacity: 0.10;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 34px 34px;
    }

    .nav {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      padding: 24px 0;
    }

    .nav-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 62px;
      height: 62px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(111,138,58,0.35);
      background: rgba(111,138,58,0.08);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--green);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
    }

    .brand-text-top {
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .brand-text-bottom {
      color: #d4d4d8;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.38em;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .nav-right {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #d4d4d8;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { color: white; }

    .phone-pill {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      color: #e4e4e7;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      padding: 64px 0 100px;
    }

    .hero-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .hero-left { max-width: 760px; }

    .hero-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(111,138,58,0.3);
      background: rgba(111,138,58,0.10);
      color: #c9d8a8;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(52px, 7vw, 86px);
      line-height: 0.95;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .hero-title span {
      display: block;
      color: var(--silver);
    }

    .hero-copy {
      margin-top: 24px;
      max-width: 700px;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #d4d4d8;
    }

    .hero-card {
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.30);
    }

    .hero-card-inner {
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #18181b, #09090b 60%, #000000);
    }

    .featured-pill {
      display: inline-block;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(111,138,58,0.30);
      background: rgba(111,138,58,0.10);
      color: #c9d8a8;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .featured-title {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .featured-copy {
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: #d4d4d8;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .mini-list {
      margin: 24px 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .mini-list li {
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      padding: 14px 16px;
      color: #e4e4e7;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 24px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(111,138,58,0.30);
      background: rgba(111,138,58,0.08);
      padding: 16px;
      color: #d4d4d8;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* Guide cards */
    .guide-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .guide-card { padding: 32px; }

    .step-number {
      font-size: 64px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: rgba(111,138,58,0.80);
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .step-title {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .step-copy {
      margin-top: 16px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .step-list {
      margin: 18px 0 0;
      padding-left: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .photo-placeholder {
      margin-top: 24px;
      min-height: 270px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(111,138,58,0.07), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)),
        #0f0f10;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 28px;
      color: var(--muted-2);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .photo-placeholder strong {
      display: block;
      color: #e4e4e7;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .photo-grid-2,
    .photo-grid-3 {
      margin-top: 24px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .photo-grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .photo-grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }

    .tight-photo .photo-placeholder,
    .photo-grid-2 .photo-placeholder,
    .photo-grid-3 .photo-placeholder {
      margin-top: 0;
      min-height: 220px;
    }

    .section-step-head {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: start;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .section-step-head .step-number {
      margin-top: -4px;
    }

    .section-step-head .section-copy {
      max-width: none;
    }

    /* Four point section */
    .four-point-wrap {
      margin-top: 32px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .point-card {
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.24);
    }

    .point-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--muted-2);
    }

    .point-title {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .rule-banner {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(111,138,58,0.30);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(111,138,58,0.12), rgba(0,0,0,0.22));
      text-align: center;
    }

    .rule-banner strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 38px);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .rule-banner span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* Correct / incorrect comparisons */
    .compare-grid {
      margin-top: 32px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .compare-card {
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--panel);
    }

    .compare-head {
      padding: 20px 22px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .compare-status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .compare-status.good { color: #c9d8a8; }
    .compare-status.bad { color: #d79b97; }

    .status-icon {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border: 1px solid currentColor;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .compare-image {
      min-height: 260px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 28px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted-2);
      line-height: 1.7;
      background: #101011;
    }

    .compare-card.good .compare-image {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-soft), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));
    }

    .compare-card.bad .compare-image {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-soft), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));
    }

    .compare-copy {
      padding: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .mistake-group + .mistake-group { margin-top: 44px; }

    .mistake-title {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 6px;
    }

    .mistake-note {
      color: var(--muted-2);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* Checklist */
    .check-grid {
      margin-top: 32px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .check-item {
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      color: #e4e4e7;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .check-box {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      flex: 0 0 20px;
      margin-top: 2px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(111,138,58,0.55);
      background: rgba(111,138,58,0.08);
    }

    .ten-second {
      border: 1px solid rgba(111,138,58,0.30);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(111,138,58,0.10), rgba(0,0,0,0.22));
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 34px;
    }

    .ten-second-grid {
      margin-top: 24px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .ten-chip {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px 14px;
      text-align: center;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.10em;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .contact-card { padding: 32px; }

    .contact-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--muted-2);
    }

    .contact-value.big {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: white;
    }

    .contact-button {
      margin-top: 20px;
      display: inline-block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--green);
      color: #000;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    }

    .legal-note {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted-2);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .hero-layout,
      .guide-grid,
      .compare-grid,
      .contact-grid,
      .photo-grid-2,
      .photo-grid-3 {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .nav-links,
      .phone-pill {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero { min-height: auto; }
      .hero-content { padding-bottom: 80px; }
      .brand-text-top { font-size: 24px; }
      .ten-second-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .container { width: min(100% - 28px, 1200px); }
      .section { padding: 58px 0; }
      .hero-title { font-size: 44px; }
      .hero-copy { font-size: 17px; }
      .hero-card-inner,
      .guide-card,
      .contact-card,
      .ten-second { padding: 24px; }
      .brand-mark { width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 15px; }
      .brand-text-top { font-size: 20px; }
      .brand-text-bottom { font-size: 10px; }
      .four-point-wrap,
      .check-grid,
      .ten-second-grid,
      .photo-grid-2,
      .photo-grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .photo-placeholder,
      .compare-image { min-height: 220px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid"></div>

    <div class="nav">
      <div class="container nav-inner">
        <a href="index.html" class="brand">
          <div class="brand-mark">PE</div>
          <div>
            <div class="brand-text-top">PINNACLE</div>
            <div class="brand-text-bottom">EQUIPMENT</div>
          </div>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-right">
          <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#load">Load</a>
            <a href="#secure">Secure</a>
            <a href="#attachments">Attachments</a>
            <a href="#final-check">Final Check</a>
          </div>
          <a href="tel:3302729911" class="phone-pill">330-272-9911</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="container hero-layout">
        <div class="hero-left">
          <div class="hero-pill">Pinnacle Equipment Trailer Quick Reference</div>
          <h1 class="hero-title">
            MT100 Loading
            <span>& Tie-Down Guide</span>
          </h1>
          <div class="hero-copy">
            Use this page as a quick reference when transporting the Bobcat MT100 with the Pinnacle Equipment trailer. Follow the loading position and tie-down examples shown below before entering the roadway.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-inner">
            <div class="featured-pill">Before You Move</div>
            <div class="featured-title">Four-Point Securement</div>
            <div class="featured-copy">Pinnacle's standard setup is intentionally simple and repeatable.</div>
            <ul class="mini-list">
              <li>4 individual rated chains</li>
              <li>4 individual rated binders</li>
              <li>4 designated MT100 tie-down points</li>
              <li>Machine positioned at the marked transport point</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="notice">
              If anything does not match the photos on this page, stop and contact Pinnacle Equipment before transporting the machine.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="load" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Loading</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Load it the same way every time</h2>
      <div class="section-copy">The goal is to remove guesswork. Each step below will eventually use a photo of the actual Pinnacle trailer and MT100 so the customer can compare the guide directly with what is in front of them.</div>

      <div class="guide-grid">
        <div class="card guide-card">
          <div class="step-number">01</div>
          <div class="step-title">Check the trailer first</div>
          <div class="step-copy">Before loading, verify the trailer is completely connected and ready to accept the machine.</div>
          <ul class="step-list">
            <li>Coupler locked</li>
            <li>Safety chains connected</li>
            <li>Breakaway cable connected</li>
            <li>Electrical plug connected</li>
            <li>Jack fully raised</li>
            <li>Tilt lock engaged for transport</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="photo-grid-2">
            <div class="photo-placeholder">
              <div><strong>Photo Placeholder</strong>Full hitch / coupler setup with the correct connection points labeled.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="photo-placeholder">
              <div><strong>Reminder Photo</strong>Close-up of the trailer tilt lock / latch fully engaged before transport.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card guide-card">
          <div class="step-number">02</div>
          <div class="step-title">Back the MT100 on</div>
          <div class="step-copy">With the standard bucket, align the machine straight with the trailer and back onto the deck slowly. Keep the bucket low and keep bystanders clear.</div>
          <div class="photo-placeholder">
            <div><strong>Photo Placeholder</strong>Rear three-quarter view showing the MT100 aligned with the trailer and a subtle “BACK ON →” annotation.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card guide-card">
          <div class="step-number">03</div>
          <div class="step-title">Stop at the marked position</div>
          <div class="step-copy">Continue backward until the designated reference point on the MT100 lines up with the marked transport position on the trailer.</div>
          <div class="photo-placeholder">
            <div><strong>Photo Placeholder</strong>Side profile showing the exact stopping position with a “STOP HERE ↓” marker.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card guide-card">
          <div class="step-number">04</div>
          <div class="step-title">Lower and shut down</div>
          <div class="step-copy">Center the machine, lower the bucket or approved attachment completely, return the controls to neutral, and shut the engine off before installing the tie-downs.</div>
          <div class="compare-grid">
            <div class="compare-card good">
              <div class="compare-head">
                <div class="compare-status good"><span class="status-icon">✓</span> Correct</div>
              </div>
              <div class="compare-image">PHOTO: Bucket or approved attachment fully lowered onto the trailer deck.</div>
              <div class="compare-copy">Bucket is fully lowered on the trailer floor and the machine is centered before securement begins.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="compare-card bad">
              <div class="compare-head">
                <div class="compare-status bad"><span class="status-icon">×</span> Incorrect</div>
              </div>
              <div class="compare-image">PHOTO: Bucket tilted up / not fully lowered.</div>
              <div class="compare-copy">Do not leave the bucket tilted upward or hanging above the deck before transport.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="notice" style="margin-top:24px;">
            <strong style="display:block; color:#fff; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.12em; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:8px;">Before moving to Step 05</strong>
            Return the trailer tilt mechanism to the transport position and make sure the tilt latch is fully locked back into place before securing the machine.
          </div>
          <div class="photo-placeholder" style="min-height:220px;">
            <div><strong>Reminder Photo</strong>Close-up showing the trailer tilt latch fully engaged in the locked transport position.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="secure" class="section muted-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-step-head">
        <div class="step-number">05</div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Securement</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Secure the machine</h2>
          <div class="section-copy">Each corner uses its own independent chain and binder. The close-up photos below should show exactly where each chain connects on the MT100 and exactly which trailer pocket or anchor it uses.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rule-banner">
        <strong>One corner = one independent tie-down</strong>
        <span>No shared front chain. No shared rear chain. Each corner is secured independently.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="four-point-wrap">
        <div class="point-card">
          <div class="point-label">Chain 1</div>
          <div class="point-title">Front Left</div>
          <div class="photo-placeholder"><div><strong>Close-Up Photo</strong>MT100 front-left designated tie-down point to the correct trailer anchor.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="point-card">
          <div class="point-label">Chain 2</div>
          <div class="point-title">Front Right</div>
          <div class="photo-placeholder"><div><strong>Close-Up Photo</strong>MT100 front-right designated tie-down point to the correct trailer anchor.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="point-card">
          <div class="point-label">Chain 3</div>
          <div class="point-title">Rear Left</div>
          <div class="photo-placeholder"><div><strong>Close-Up Photo</strong>MT100 rear-left designated tie-down point to the correct trailer anchor.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="point-card">
          <div class="point-label">Chain 4</div>
          <div class="point-title">Rear Right</div>
          <div class="photo-placeholder"><div><strong>Close-Up Photo</strong>MT100 rear-right designated tie-down point to the correct trailer anchor.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="compare-grid" style="margin-top:32px;">
        <div class="compare-card good">
          <div class="compare-head">
            <div class="compare-status good"><span class="status-icon">✓</span> Correct Chain Pocket Connection</div>
          </div>
          <div class="compare-image">PHOTO: Hook fully seated in the approved trailer chain pocket / anchor.</div>
          <div class="compare-copy">Hook is fully engaged in the intended securement point and aligned so it cannot easily roll or slip off the edge.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="compare-card bad">
          <div class="compare-head">
            <div class="compare-status bad"><span class="status-icon">×</span> Incorrect Chain Pocket Connection</div>
          </div>
          <div class="compare-image">PHOTO: Hook caught only on the lip or edge of the pocket.</div>
          <div class="compare-copy">Do not catch the hook only on an edge, lip, thin section, or other location not intended to carry the tie-down load.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="final-check" class="section muted-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Final Walk-Around</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Check it before you pull away</h2>
      <div class="section-copy">Walk completely around the trailer and verify each item below before entering the roadway.</div>

      <div class="check-grid">
        <div class="check-item"><span class="check-box"></span>Machine is centered and aligned with the marked transport position</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="check-box"></span>Bucket or approved attachment is fully lowered</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="check-box"></span>Engine is off</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="check-box"></span>Front-left chain and binder are secure</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="check-box"></span>Front-right chain and binder are secure</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="check-box"></span>Rear-left chain and binder are secure</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="check-box"></span>Rear-right chain and binder are secure</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="check-box"></span>No chains or loose items are dragging or hanging</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="check-box"></span>Coupler, safety chains, breakaway cable and electrical plug are connected</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="check-box"></span>Trailer jack is raised, tilt lock is engaged, and lights are working</div>
      </div>

      <div class="ten-second" style="margin-top:34px;">
        <div class="eyebrow">10-Second Check</div>
        <h3 class="section-title" style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px); margin-bottom:0;">Before you pull away</h3>
        <div class="ten-second-grid">
          <div class="ten-chip">4 Chains</div>
          <div class="ten-chip">4 Binders</div>
          <div class="ten-chip">Bucket Down</div>
          <div class="ten-chip">Tilt Locked</div>
          <div class="ten-chip">Nothing Loose</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="attachments" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Attachments</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Attachment-specific transport</h2>
      <div class="section-copy">Use multiple example photos here so renters can quickly compare the setup in front of them. Bucket and fork examples can show a few acceptable transport positions. The auger is typically transported attached to the machine, so that section should show the mounted configuration from more than one angle.</div>

      <div class="guide-grid">
        <div class="card guide-card">
          <div class="step-title" style="margin-top:0;">Bucket / Forks</div>
          <div class="step-copy">Show a few approved examples for the bucket and fork setup so the customer can identify the closest match.</div>
          <div class="photo-grid-3">
            <div class="photo-placeholder"><div><strong>Example Photo 1</strong>Bucket fully lowered on the trailer deck in the finalized transport position.</div></div>
            <div class="photo-placeholder"><div><strong>Example Photo 2</strong>Fork setup example showing the approved fork transport position and orientation.</div></div>
            <div class="photo-placeholder"><div><strong>Example Photo 3</strong>Alternate approved bucket / fork securement example if applicable.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card guide-card">
          <div class="step-title" style="margin-top:0;">Auger</div>
          <div class="step-copy">The auger will typically be secured to the machine during transport. Show two views of the mounted auger setup so the customer can confirm the bit position and securement method.</div>
          <div class="photo-grid-2">
            <div class="photo-placeholder"><div><strong>Example Photo 1</strong>Primary view of the auger mounted to the machine in the approved transport position.</div></div>
            <div class="photo-placeholder"><div><strong>Example Photo 2</strong>Secondary angle showing the auger securement details and transport orientation.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

