      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Need Help?</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Something doesn’t look right?</h2>
        <div class="section-copy">Do not guess. If the chain route, machine position, trailer connection, or attachment setup does not match the guide, contact Pinnacle Equipment before transporting the machine.</div>
      </div>

